ackrevolutionarycollective.com #blackunity #fyp #blackwomen #blackmen #politics", "duration": 177.75, "timestamp": 1779214095, "uploader_id": "44430625902", "uploader": "Black Revolutionary Collective", "channel": "blackrevolutionarycollective", "like_count": 12135, "comment_count": 1009, "comments": [{"author": "georgette.kristina", "author_id": "9939840762", "id": "18079820909336659", "text": "The best political move we could make is divest all money in their banks and transfer it into black banks again. Average yearly spending of African Americans is 9 trillion dollars. Then we could use that money to start our own people funded pharmaceutical companies and more.", "timestamp": 1779471023}, {"author": "charlespreston864", "author_id": "7926197743", "id": "18092468234214603", "text": "🖤🖤🖤🖤💯💯💯💯💯💯", "timestamp": 1779470830}, {"author": "nerdcorewoody", "author_id": "75777677451", "id": "18044106833583056", "text": "By all means I respect this. Yet I think in order for it to be efficient, we need to consider the fact that: infiltration, scandals, and assassinations will take place. Wasn’t Malcom unalive by one of our own?", "timestamp": 1779470624}, {"author": "janellgotyourback_", "author_id": "55582556200", "id": "18013453286891432", "text": "Copper indigenous ONLY", "timestamp": 1779469132}, {"author": "nastyhaven203", "author_id": "80035617958", "id": "18341460103175627", "text": "Black people are being erased. The massive influx of illegals has made your vote weaker and weaker. Just look at the black neighborhoods. Half of them are Latino now. It’s time to stop the YN activities and focus on getting ourselves into a better place.", "timestamp": 1779467432}, {"author": "luckyonelove702", "author_id": "434655819", "id": "17994217403957400", "text": "❤️🖤💚", "timestamp": 1779466986}], "thumbnails": [{"url": "https://scontent-bos5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/703376804_1510264724132723_4847362571744687511_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6ImltYWd